imuttiṁ parimuttiṁ vadanti kathenti bhaṇanti dīpayanti voharanti, “sassato loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan”ti suddhiṁ visuddhiṁ parisuddhiṁ, muttiṁ vimuttiṁ parimuttiṁ vadanti kathenti bhaṇanti dīpayanti voharanti, “asassato loko. Antavā loko. Anantavā loko. Taṁ jīvaṁ taṁ sarīraṁ. Aññaṁ jīvaṁ aññaṁ sarīraṁ. Hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā. Na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā. Hoti ca na ca hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā. Neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan”ti suddhiṁ visuddhiṁ parisuddhiṁ, muttiṁ vimuttiṁ parimuttiṁ vadanti kathenti bhaṇanti dīpayanti voharantīti idheva suddhiṁ iti vādayanti.","v":"24Khu07","n":59,"p":124,"s":"Pasūrasuttaniddesa","w":4,"k":["idhev","it","sudh","vadayant"]},{"l":"Idheva suddhiṁ iti vādayantī","g":"idha suddhiṁ visuddhiṁ parisuddhiṁ, muttiṁ vimuttiṁ parimuttiṁ vadanti kathenti bhaṇanti dīpayanti voharanti, “sassato loko, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan”ti idha suddhiṁ visuddhiṁ parisuddhiṁ muttiṁ vimuttiṁ parimuttiṁ vadanti kathenti bhaṇanti dīpayanti voharanti, “asassato loko -pa- neva hoti na na hoti tathāgato paraṁ maraṇā, idameva saccaṁ moghamaññan”ti idha suddhiṁ visuddhiṁ parisuddhiṁ, muttiṁ vimuttiṁ parimuttiṁ vadanti kathenti bhaṇanti dīpayanti voharantīti idheva suddhiṁ iti vādayanti.","v":"24Khu07","n":127,"p":233,"s":"Cūḷabyūhasuttaniddesa","w":4,"k":["idhev","it","sudh","vadayant"]},{"l":"Idheva sambodhimanuttaraṁ phuse","g":"imasmiṁ yeva attabhāve aggamaggaṁ arahattaṁ vā phuse pāpuṇeyya.","v":"24KhuA05","n":34,"p":100,"s":"Ātāpīsuttavaṇṇanā","w":3,"k":["idhev","phus","sambodhimanutar"]},{"l":"Idhevā","g":"imasmiṁyeva attabhāve.","v":"24KhuA05","n":44,"p":157,"s":"Nibbānadhātusuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["idhev"]},{"l":"Idhevā","g":"imasmiṁyeva attabhāve.","v":"24KhuA05","n":84,"p":248,"s":"Bahujanahitasuttavaṇṇanā","w":1,"k":["idhev"]},{"l":"Idheva khayamattano","g":"āsavakkhayādhigamena attano vaṭṭadukkhahetuno samudayapakkhiyassa kilesagaṇassa idheva imasmiṁyeva attabhāve khayaṁ anuppādaṁ pajānāti, vaṭṭa